  "title": "NASA’s SpaceX Crew-12 Returns to Earth, Launches to International Space Station",
  "summary": "NASA’s SpaceX Crew-12 mission successfully splashed down in the Pacific Ocean off the coast of California, marking a successful return to Earth after an eight-month space mission. The crew included NASA astronauts Jessica Meir and Jack Hathaway, ESA astronaut Sophie Adenot, and Roscosmos cosmonaut Andrey Fedyaev, completing their mission safely.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "NASA’s SpaceX Crew-12 mission successfully splashed down in the Pacific Ocean off the coast of California on Oct. 8, 2026.",
