      "title": "NASA Briefing to Highlight Contributions to Martian Moons Mission",
      "link": "https://www.nasa.gov/news-release/nasa-briefing-to-highlight-contributions-to-martian-moons-mission/",
      "description": "Media are invited to join NASA for a media teleconference at 4 p.m. EDT, Thursday, Oct. 15, to preview the agency’s contributions to JAXA’s (Japan Aerospace Exploration Agency) Martian Moons eXploration (MMX) mission. The mission is scheduled to launch from JAXA’s Tanegashima Space Center in Japan on Monday, Oct. 19 EDT (Tuesday, Oct. 20 JST). [&#8230;]",
